31,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The minutes show no review in five years. The complaints died out.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Daily riders prefer paying. The rain row is useless in winter.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,Four shifts needed in two mornings. The upper rack is hard to use.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The ledger is empty. The ward park costs 2,600 yen with a waitlist.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Reconciliation takes three hours monthly. Neighbours stopped meeting over fees.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if neighbours stopped meeting, does that mean fees cause conflict?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, if the ward park is full, our demand is high.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,The physical effort of the rack is a barrier for some.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The building has no capital funds. Any fix needs a levy.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"The administrative load is real. It’s not just money, it’s time.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we charge, we risk the same social breakdown as the neighbours.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"But if we don’t, the rain spots stay empty and the dry ones fight.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Shared racks might solve the morning shoving, but the lift is tough.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A lottery avoids the daily admin, but ignores the rain issue.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,A lottery is low maintenance. But does it solve the morning chaos?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I fear a lottery creates resentment if the same people win.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,The sticker register shows varied needs. One size doesn’t fit all.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,We need a solution that doesn’t require constant policing.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,The ward park proves people will pay for certainty.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Certainty costs admin time. We have to weigh that.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
