60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A risks social fracture. Option B is fair but static. Option C is chaotic.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option C ignores the rain. Option A is expensive. Option B is simple.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option C solves the morning rush. Option A is too complex. Option B is random.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A generates revenue. Option B is free but unfair. Option C is risky.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B has the lowest admin burden. Option A is a trap. Option C is unstable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, do you think we can handle the admin for Option A?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, is the revenue from Option A enough to cover the levy?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, does Option B really prevent the morning shoving?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, does Option C actually solve the rain problem?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, is the physical effort of Option C a dealbreaker?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for B. It’s the least likely to cause social strife.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I vote for B. It’s fair and simple.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for C. It solves the immediate physical conflict.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I vote for A. It funds the building and reflects value.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for B. It minimizes the administrative burden on us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
